.TH WSLX 1 "September 2026" "WSLX 0.1.0-dev" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wslx \- Windows and WSL productivity toolkit
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wslx
.RI < command >
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
WSLX is a modular command-line toolkit intended to make Windows and WSL
interoperation safer and faster. Foundation 001 provides the project shell,
installer, uninstaller, diagnostics, documentation discipline and tests.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B help
Show top-level help.
.TP
.B version
Print the installed version.
.TP
.B doctor
Run foundation environment checks.
.TP
.B uninstall
Remove the current user installation.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/bin/wslx
Default CLI entry point.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/wslx
Default WSLX data directory.
.TP
.I ~/.bashrc
Contains one optional, clearly marked WSLX managed block.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bash (1),
.BR wslpath (1)
